{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>屯門發生爆竊案。昨日（26日）下午1時許，警方接獲一名60歲李姓女子報案，懷疑其位於嘉和里山路2號帝灣居的住所遭到爆竊。</p><p>警員接報到場，發現上址房間窗戶被撬，經初步點算後，相信上址有一隻約值13萬元的手錶和共值約61萬元的金器不知所終。經初步調查，案件列作爆竊，交由屯門警區刑事調查隊第六隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>據了解，案中手錶是勞力士。</p><figure><img alt=\"屯門帝灣居。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261127/1202844341882589184680951.jpeg/aUiBBkqP4GcK4FZwuBK1a9Ngn0v3wAMnr6mYjq-pmI4\"/><figcaption>屯門帝灣居。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T21:04:30.781555+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T20:42:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T21:37:46.162631+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T20:57:48.274494+00:00","content_hash":"6956f80cd0f1651f4f91970a7437d91d541be547a88c8ccb142fe84cedb4fc5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}